<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105094" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐ-όρχης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with three testicles</i>: metaph., <i>very lecherous,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Timae.
				145
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
			hawk, perh. <i>buzzard, Buteo vulgaris,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1181
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				592b3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				609a24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				620a17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.8.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριόρχας αἰετούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					148
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖδες τ.</span> (with pun on
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρχέομαι</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1534
			</span></i> cod. B (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οις</span> codd. RV)
			(lyr.); 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίορχος.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενταυρίς</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				25.69
			</span></i> (where <i>triorchis,</i> mistranslating <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
			</span></i> l. c.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεραπιάς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				15.13
			</span></i>, Paul. Aeg.<i><span class="en">
				4.25
			</span></i>.</div>
